WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Jumping medium punch counter-hits Ryu in the air.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.650
Heavy Zanku Hadoken extends the airborne hit.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.050
Akuma lands and uses raw Drive Rush.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.850
Standing heavy punch catches the falling opponent.

5
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.550
Medium Tatsu finishes the grounded juggle.

6
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.450
Ryu recovers after the air-to-air conversion.
